Version History:

v1.28 to v1.28h-
	o Added COMAS to big numbers... (procedure)
	o Made special directory for users, and user mail.
	o Fixed a few bugs.
	o Made it so it will allow commas in input. (for numbers).
	o Made it so it won't show commas in numbers with E+ in them...
	o Added a limit to the times you can play the Casino.
	o Fixed a user-battle bug...
	o Fixed a battle text error.
	o Made it harder to get diseases in forest.
	o Made a check to see if a disease already exists in forest.
	o Fixed a disease error.
	o Added sysop option to reset TDL.LOG
	o Added a routine to only allow key presses required... Does not clear
	  screen when you press a key not allowed. Nice for people at slow
	  baud rates.
	o Added Expert Mode to a few more menus.
	o Fixed battle format... (Potions)
	o Fixed Item Shop to show GP with commas.
	o Fixed menu RETURNS. (Stats, and Equipment).
	o Added commas to Experience, and Turns in High Score lists..
	o Added prompts to show your certain stats at level up...
	o Fixed SysOp and preTDL menus.
	o ReFixed all menus, and such...
	o Fixed user fight error.
	o Added level after status when listing players in Arena.
	o Fixed conversations prompt error.
	o Made the game allow up to 999 players...
	o Redrew All User Lists. (Arena, Main, High Scores, etc...)
	o Made color scheme more consistent.
	o Made a COMPLETELY _NEW_ look to BATTLES!
	o Added a prompt to make _sure_ you want to RUN AWAY.
	o Fixed a joust error. A CLS was in the wrong place.
	o Change battle look back to the original form, due to lack of speed.
	o Fixed SysOp option when editting your own account.
	o Made it so it doesn't save if nothing was changed. (SysOp Menu)
	o Made it harder to catch disease each turn...
	o Made In-Mates in Jail able to use POTIONS.
	o Fixed a battle error.
	o Fixed a potion defaults error.
	o Made layout of text when starting game easier to read quickly.
	o Fixed another Potions Default error.
	o Changed forest level to 6, which is the true level, instead of 9.
	o Made it add a log to news when user actually does get a disease.
	o Added option to WAIT if another player is already playing! Real nice!
	o Added option to go back and edit a line in EMAIL editor!
	o Finally took out the dat.dat file completely. Now has all texts
	  inside of game itself... (Less files for SysOps to deal with...)
	o Fixed a logout error in game.
	o Added option in user fights to make it show only between to level
	  variables, one high and the other low.
	o Changed look of Tremendous Hits to make them different, and easier
	  to know who got one...
	o Fixed an error in user battle news. Didn't add coma to GP obtained.
	o Fixed a logout error.
	o Fixed a time-up error.
	o Fixed two user potion use errors.
	o Fixed a casino error. Wasn't updating max GP on slot machine.

v1.29 to v1.29c-
	o Wrote procedure to convert E+ numbers to standard format, and then
	  add comas to it. Very nice!!
	o Changed user list to make it only show up if a '?' is pressed.
	o Fixed a jail potion error.
	o Fixed jousting error. Wasn't logging or recording joust deaths.
	o Fixed an error in user list for arena.
	o Fixed a jousting error. If you killed another player, it also killed
	  you!
	o Made a limit on amount of potions shopkeeper owns per turn.

v1.30-
	o Made option to change between ANSI/ASCII.
	o Made it check for emulation.
	o Made it save all defaults! (Color/Expert/Emulation)
	o Changed Main Menu.
	o Fixed an error with preTDL menu.
	o Fixed some logout errors.
	o Added multi Tremendous Hits to make each one progressively more
	  powerful, if in the same round!

v1.31-
	o Added option to roll stats for new users. More variaty in stats this
	  way.
	o Added option to allow a reset for players.

v1.32-
	o Made it harder to get a disease in the forest.
	o Made the a lesser amount of forest monsters attack you.
	o Made option to run away from fights in forest!
	o Made potion use limitations universal to all players, not just those
	  being attacked, but the attacker. (The one attacking someone else.)
	  The limits are: 1 Potion of Healing & 1 Potion of Extra-Healing per
	  attack the player has.
	o Added damage bonuses for higher Strength.
	o Made it hit more often with higher Strength.
	o Gave bonus Hitpoint gain for higher Constitution.
	o Gave AC bonus for higher Dexterity.

v1.33 to v1.33b-
	o Added a show of Joust Points when a user list during a joust is
	  done.
	o Added a show of Boxing Points when a user list during a box is done.
	o Added a comma add for after you buy a weapon, and it shows you GP
	  remaining.
	o Added option to have a gang do things to another user. NICE!
	   1) Throw a user in a pit with monsters
	   2) Have the gang kick the user's ass
	   3) Hire a mercenary to kill the user
	   4) Hire a thief to rob the user
	   5) Put a bounty on a user's head
	o Made odds in Casino fair, and made payoff less.
	o Added Beta Version comments to file.
	o Added Fido/CLink addresses to docs, registration, and errors.
	o Finished beta-version, ready for a release.
	o Fixed an alley printout error. Forgot a variable when I added all
	  texts from dat.dat file.
	o Fixed an error in the Docs.dat file.
	o Added option to use keypad, or arrowpad for movement in forest!

v1.34 to v1.34a-
	o Made game log to news when a jackpot is hit in slow machine!
	o Shortened code, and speeded up game by adding ANSI codes for long
	  spaces in menus.
	o Added multi-player abilities! Now more than one person can play at
	  a time!! Very nice addition!
	o Made it harder to catch disease in forest.
	o Shortened code alittle.
	o Fixed an E-Mail bug.
	o Fixed a Multi-User bug...

v1.35-
	o Cleaned up code majorly.
	o Rewrote file handling routines.
	o Put menus into single files to speed up load-time.

v1.35a-
	o Fixed a level up error.
	o Cleaned up code alittle more.
	o Reformatted look to High Scores.
	o Rewrote % accomplishments for High Scores.
	o Reformatted the look to all the charts.
	o Added conditions to user you are boxing!
	o Removed old multi-user routines, do to too many errors.
	o Only one user can play at a time again.
	o Fixed a Joust display error.
	o Made it check time left online to figure if less than 20 minutes.

v1.35b-
	o Fixed a few grammatical errors.
	o Cleaned up some do loops.
	o Cleaned out excessive coding.
	o Reformatted ANSI codes.
	o Fixed a boxing syntax error.

v1.35c-
	o Cleaned up News format.
	o News is now abortable.
	o Made jousting odds less for "special" happenings.
	o Made jousing points max 999.
	o When losing a boxing match, you no longer lose a point(s).
	o Cleaned up the old Query format.
	o Put sysop options back into program (as external file).
	o Made news logging routine one single procedure.
	o Made logs for new users or rerolls.
	o Fixed some problems with emailer.
	o Made viewing the docs abortable.
	o Made updates file abortable.

v1.35d-
	o Made all menus files.
	o Rewrote emulation checks.
	o Partially rewrote color checks.
	o Rewrote some data files.
	o Fixed a problem with the new user starter.dat file. (Started with
	  2 turns instead of 1)

v1.35e-
	o Fixed a battle error (could use more potions per turn than allowed)
	o Made it not diplay the use potions if you don't have any.
	o Cleaned up alot of unneccisary CALL commands.
	o Rewrote handling of Jail Routine.
	o Cleaned up maintenance of walls.
	o Added more of the menus to ANSI/ASCII/COLOR format.
	o Fixed a reroll color error.

v1.36-
	o Troy Sisley (Chaos) now an assistant designer!
	o Added more weapons and armor.
	o Cut out accidental two-handed weapons from original selection.
	o Rewrote Slot Machine Routine!
	o Cut XP gain from in-mates in half.
	o Fixed an error when using potions in battle.

v1.36a-
	o Added Male/Female pronouns for players.

v1.36b-
	o Fixed the black market menu. (wrong letter code).
	o Rewrote bar fight routine to make it more random, and more things
	  happening.
	o Rewrote Alley House Break-ins. More floors.
	o Made it only add a turn and subtract a daily turn when you actually
	  use the play option from the pre-main menu.
	o Moved show of financial statuses to when you actually start.
	o Made it show total times played TDL in login.
	o Fixed a hospital display error.
	o Added a show of invested money when viewing bank balance.
	o Rewrote the way it figures user Experience in a user-user battle.
	o Rewrote Comma routine to make a maximum amount variable count of
	  14 digits. No more need for scientific notation numbers.
	o Fixed a level up error. Wasn't refiguring bonuses to stats.
	o Fixed a jail "in-mate" battle display error.

v1.37-
	o Rewrote huge sections of game! Now totally new file operation!
	o Wrote all the shop routines into one.
	o Made all objects into one data file.
	o Store objects as only ID # in user files.
	o Store default attack with left/right hand in user file.
	o Use two-handed weapons.
	o Made it possible to pick which hand to equipt shield in.
	o Rewrote battle routine.
	o Added conditions to battle.
	o Cleaned up more unneccisary CALL functions.
	o Cleaned up snubbing people in the alley.
	o Made it log to the news when a player attacked and ran from a user
	  battle/joust/boxing, or a jail fight.
	o Took out talk scripts and put them into an array in a seperate file.
	o Added different attack types to the battle!
	o Rewrote email routine so that it just uses CNet's email system.
	o Rewrote emulation handling.
	o Rewrote maintenance to be all one big chunk of the program, instead
	  of a bunch of seperate subs and routines.
	o Converted more menus into ASCII/ANSI/COLOR file format.
	o Rewrote robbing bank routine.
	o Cleaned up hiring gang routines alittle.
	o Reformatted look to Equipment screen.
	o Rewrote way it figures Armor Class. (routine)
	o Rewrote way it saves/stores next level EXP.
	o Made it display grafitti as a file.
	o Put some larger sections of text into files.
	o Changed the look to the battles.
	o Rewrote boxing routine. Gave it an all new look.

v1.37a-
	o Fixed battle variable error for the menu for potion use.
	o Fixed an expertmode error in battles.
	o Moved Gang section to a seperate external file!


